 "doc": "M4-C11-02 greybox (tools/act1/ch11_greybox.py; do not edit by hand): Lowlight, the temple half underwater (colour script ch11). The atrium at the gate (Gate; the lamp bench for Rhen and Liss's side scene, lamp_bench), the Lamp Engine's hall north of it (EngineHall: the boss's arena, its conduits bleeding bound teal), and east the well-shaft: two flights down (ramps) past the waterline (y -2: the temple is drowned below it) to the drowned sanctum at the shaft's foot (Sanctum, nhoa: Nhoa's binding; the light from the well-shaft above). Back to Sunken Vey at to_vey. The story, and whether the lower temple is swum or walked, wait on the beat sheet (M4-C11-01).",
